  <num>34-1806</num>
  <heading>Replacement of equipment.</heading>
  <text>No later than October 1, 2007, the Office of Unified Communications shall establish a schedule for the replacement of equipment for the 911 system. The schedule shall be updated on February 1 of each subsequent year.</text>
